3                            =TOTAL NUMBER OF WIRES
20                           =NUMBER OF FOURIER COEFFICIENTS
2                            =NUMBER OF REFERENCE WIRE
7.5                          =WIRE RADIUS (mils)
10.0                         =INSULATION THICKNESS (mils)
3.5                          =RELATIVE DIELECTRIC CONSTANT OF INSULATION
50.0                         =ADJACENT WIRE SEPARATION (mils)
